# VS Code
.vscode/

# Generated, heavy ingest output — served from Cloudflare R2 in remote mode, never committed.
# Audio streams from the PRIVATE bucket via the signing Worker; covers + the proof-of-work
# report (with full-fidelity canvas video/gif/spectrograms) come from the PUBLIC bucket,
# served from PUBLIC_R2_BASE_URL (cdn.lufsaud.io). Keeping these out of git is what keeps the
# Hostinger deploy under GitHub's 2GB pack limit. In local mode they're regenerated under
# public/ on every ingest, so they never need committing either.
public/audio/
public/covers/
public/reports/
